---
---

<section class="how-it-works-section">
  <div class="section-header-centered">
    <span class="retro-badge" style="background: var(--pastel-mint)">⚡ FAST & TRANSPARENT</span>
    <h3 class="section-title">Campus Redressal Pipeline</h3>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      From initial submission to verified maintenance fix, every ticket follows a strict 4-step university protocol.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="steps-grid">
    <!-- Step 1 -->
    <div class="neo-card step-card">
      <div class="step-badge-tag">STEP 01</div>
      <div class="step-icon-wrap" style="background: var(--pastel-yellow)">
        <span>📝</span>
      </div>
      <h4 class="step-heading">File Complaint</h4>
      <p class="step-desc">
        Submit issue with location and priority. Toggle <strong>Public Wall</strong> or sealed <strong>Confidential Vault</strong> with 🕶️ Anonymous Protection.
      </p>
      <div class="step-footer-tag">Instant Ticket ID</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2 -->
    <div class="neo-card step-card">
      <div class="step-badge-tag">STEP 02</div>
      <div class="step-icon-wrap" style="background: var(--pastel-lavender)">
        <span>🛡️</span>
      </div>
      <h4 class="step-heading">Proctorial Triage</h4>
      <p class="step-desc">
        Proctor Office verifies ticket validity within 2 hours. Ragging, harassment, and electrical hazards trigger emergency dispatch.
      </p>
      <div class="step-footer-tag">&lt; 2h Response SLA</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3 -->
    <div class="neo-card step-card">
      <div class="step-badge-tag">STEP 03</div>
      <div class="step-icon-wrap" style="background: var(--pastel-cyan)">
        <span>👷</span>
      </div>
      <h4 class="step-heading">Technician Action</h4>
      <p class="step-desc">
        Campus electricians, plumbers, or transport mechanics are assigned. Real-time updates and parts orders are logged on your ticket.
      </p>
      <div class="step-footer-tag">Live Activity Log</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 4 -->
    <div class="neo-card step-card">
      <div class="step-badge-tag">STEP 04</div>
      <div class="step-icon-wrap" style="background: var(--pastel-mint)">
        <span>✅</span>
      </div>
      <h4 class="step-heading">Verified Fix</h4>
      <p class="step-desc">
        Once inspected and completed, an official written resolution note is published. The ticket gets the green <strong>RESOLVED ✔</strong> stamp.
      </p>
      <div class="step-footer-tag">Official Sign-off</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how-it-works-section {
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }
  .section-header-centered {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--border-black);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .steps-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .step-card {
    padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    min-height: 220px;
    position: relative;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }
  .step-badge-tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1rem;
    right: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-retro);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #6b7280;
  }
  .step-icon-wrap {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border-black);
    box-shadow: 1.5px 1.5px 0px var(--border-black);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .step-heading {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    color: var(--border-black);
  }
  .step-desc {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #4b5563;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .step-footer-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-retro);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-black);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: #f8fafc;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }
</style>
